    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Set on August 12 of every year, the International Youth Day (IYD) seeks to celebrate young people, globally and shines a light on youth-related matters across the world, with this year's theme \"Youth Engagement for Global Action\" reminding us of the potential young people have and their ability to have an impact in the institutions and processes. This is at local, national and global level.",
